{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"かなりんだよぉ(ｃ)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ごめんなさい\n本当にごめんなさい\n昨日ももクロChan見てたから\n言いたくなりました←"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日はめっちゃテレビ見てた！\nめちゃイケやばかった！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ももクロChan見終わってから"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"くぎづけ大学見て\nまりちゃが可愛すぎて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりちゃに会いたすぎて\n今日久々に会えて\n嬉しくて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりちゃにナンパしてた"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/15/8903832/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ワイルドだろ〜？(ｃ)←"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/15/8903832/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でもさ\nみんなも推しとかに\nめっちゃ会いたくなるでしょ？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"中田は会いたいと思って\n会えてずるいよね"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"2sとか余裕だよ？←"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"メンとの2sの権利とか\nオクだしたら\nワンチャン財閥になれるレベル"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だから\n昨日のえりか様の写メだとか寝顔だとか\n随時メンバーの写メ載せてくね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/15/8903832/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だから許して？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"(笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「「答えちゃうお( °_ゝ°)ノ」」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"BabyCocoとNatsuどっちが好き？\n⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒\n選べない！\nどっちも大好き！\n２コ１()みたいなとこあるからね←←←"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"宇宙人いるの？\n⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒\nピータンというry←←\n中田と推し被りのかたしか\n伝わらないネタすみません○┓\nいるかもね！どうだろ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"以上！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"れいかとさゆにゃんと帰ってるよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/15/8903832/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"楽しいよ、華の94年組()←"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かな￣(=∵=)￣"}],"source":"archive"}